                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister O’Brien to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-11-20"><hi rendition="#italic">November 20,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Prince Charles accepts crown of Norway with consent of King of Denmark. Leaves
                    Thursday for Christiana.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">O’Brien.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
